│       Lambda may freeze the execution environment immediately after the     │
│  handler returns.                                                           │
│       Any non-awaited async operations (e.g., `.then().catch()` without     │
│  await, or                                                                  │
│       fire-and-forget promises) may be silently dropped, causing message    │
│  loss.                                                                      │
│       Correct pattern:                                                      │
│         await sqs.send_message(...)   # Python                              │
│         await sqsClient.send(...)     # Node.js                             │
│       Then return the HTTP response after the message is confirmed sent.    │
│     - Queue URL / Event Bus name from environment variables                 │
